  "2026-10-29T18:34:43.960Z",codex-agent,Read-only audit found the prepared 2026.10.29 ahead of npm with no tag or matching changelog section. Verified merged delivery PRs and successful release CI. Their owning items remain in_progress. Append-only pinned CLI lifecycle and release updates are explicitly authorized for recovery; unrelated open follow-ups remain open.
  "2026-10-29T18:42:43.913Z",codex,"Pinned CLI recovery closes only merged PR 183 delivery and pins release 2026.10.29. npm run changelog:full now generates the exact pending-version section; linked npm run changelog:check passed 1/1. Origin/main has no corresponding heading (negative control); metadata repair makes the same command include it. Version, source, dependency pins and workflows are unchanged. Full npm/Bun release gates require fresh exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-29T18:44:53.952Z",codex-agent,"Attribution correction: the preceding validation comment and claim release inherited the project default author because that shell invocation omitted PM_AUTHOR. Both actions were performed by codex-agent in this recovery task. Their original append-only records are retained; this explicit-author claim/release restores the intended attribution boundary. No delivery evidence or item state is rewritten."
